SUMMARY:Lake Escape Summer Kickoff
DESCRIPTION:Wilderness Union Toronto - Outdoor Adventure and Hiking Club\n
 **Please note the only way to register for this adventure is on [our websi
 te.](https://www.wildernessunion.com/adventures/lake-escape)**\n\n**Make y
 our own adventure at this amazing getaway to Six Mile Lake Provincial Park
 \, a stunning landscape that once inspired the brushes of Canada’s most 
 prolific artist collective\, the Group of Seven!**\n\nIn the morning\, we
 ’ll spend some time meandering the hiking trails and finish with a group
  lunch.\n\nThe afternoon is then your opportunity to create your own adven
 ture. If you are looking for activities\, you can rent a canoe or kayak to
  explore the lake’s many islands and hidden bays. For those who prefer a
  slower pace\, the park’s three sandy beaches are ideal for lounging wit
 h a book or taking a refreshing dip in the clear water.\n\nThe atmosphere 
 for the day is relaxed\, making it easy to drift between adventure and res
 t. Come along and dive in!\n\nPlease note that any rental costs are not in
 cluded in the price of your registration.\n\n**Highlights**\n**Sandy Beach
 es** \\- With three beautiful\\\, sandy beaches to choose from\\\, finding
  a spot to soak up the sun is simple\\.\n**Island Hopping** \\- The lake i
 s dotted with small islands and hidden inlets best explored by water\\. Re
 nt a canoe or kayak and navigate the refreshing summer waters\\.\n**Summer
  Serenity** \\- Whether you are wandering the forest trails\\\, swimming o
 r paddling\\\, you’ll find that summer magic that makes Ontario so speci
 al\\.\n\n**Event cost: $60+HST - $50 optional transport available.**\n**Re
 gister [here.](https://www.wildernessunion.com/adventures/lake-escape)**\n
 \n**About Wilderness Union**\nWilderness Union is deliberate about buildin
 g an outdoors community that connects you to the life-changing magic of th
 e outdoors and helps you find your people.\n\nMembers range from 20-40 yea
 rs old. The group is a mix of GTA locals and newcomers to Toronto from wit
 hin Canada and abroad.\n\nAttendance numbers on Meetup don't reflect our a
 ctual event attendance - we typically have 15-20 community members at each
  event. Large enough that there's someone new to meet but small enough tha
 t it's not overwhelming!\n\n***Learn more at our website [www.wildernessun
 ion.com](https://www.wildernessunion.com/)***
